  "project_description": "This module provides a simpler implementation to the Exclude Node Title module. It allows you to hide the title for standard content types and content types using\n\ndisplay suite.\n\n Instructions for Use\n\n Pre-requisite, if your using nested fieldsets group them using 'htmlelement'\n\n 1) Add a checkbox field with the machine name \"field_hide_title\" to your content type and place with the title for easy editor use.\n\n Once in place it should be easy for the content editor to hide the title of a page as needed.",
